{"type":"text","timestamp":1790451388669,"sessionID":"ses_f20cc3857ffezDR2odMktEeN9P","part":{"id":"prt_0df3810eb001qKGgenf2yzBr5N","messageID":"msg_0df37a89a001AhCrPidxGwfbu8","sessionID":"ses_f20cc3857ffezDR2odMktEeN9P","type":"text","text":"The scene has no camera/light, so rendering is just the background. The important thing is that the shader application logic runs without errors. Let me write a runtime verification test that inspects the scene tree to confirm the materials were swapped correctly with the right parameters.","time":{"start":1790451388651,"end":1790451388655},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_69e150e9c7e748e1b06cfc81cf540667_msg"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790451388702,"sessionID":"ses_f20cc3857ffezDR2odMktEeN9P","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"bash_22_04901eef","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"mkdir -p /tmp/opencode/gd_verify && cat > /tmp/opencode/gd_verify/verify_main.gd <<'EOF'\nextends SceneTree\n\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tcall_deferred(\"_run\")\n\nfunc _run() -> void:\n\tawait process_frame\n\tawait process_frame\n\tvar main_scene := load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\") as PackedScene\n\tvar main := main_scene.instantiate()\n\troot.add_child(main)\n\tawait process_frame\n\tawait process_frame\n\n\tvar wm := main.get_node(\"WeaponManager\")\n\tvar vm := wm.get_node(\"ViewModel\")\n\tvar knife := vm.get_node(\"Knife\") as MeshInstance3D\n\tassert(knife != null, \"Knife MeshInstance3D should exist\")\n\n\tvar override_count := knife.get_surface_override_material_count()\n\tprint(\"Surface override count: \", override_count)\n\tassert(override_count >= 1, \"Expected at least one surface override material\")\n\n\tvar mat := knife.get_surface_override_material(0)\n\tprint(\"Material class: \", mat.get_class())\n\tassert(mat is ShaderMaterial, \"Expected ShaderMaterial override\")\n\tvar sm := mat as ShaderMaterial\n\tassert(sm.shader != null, \"Shader should be set\")\n\tprint(\"Shader path: \", sm.shader.resource_path)\n\tassert(sm.shader.resource_path == \"res://shaders/weapon_clip_and_fov_shader.gdshader\", \"Shader path mismatch\")\n\n\tvar albedo: Color = sm.get_shader_parameter(\"albedo\")\n\tvar metallic: float = sm.get_shader_parameter(\"metallic\")\n\tvar roughness: float = sm.get_shader_parameter(\"roughness\")\n\tvar fov: float = sm.get_shader_parameter(\"viewmodel_fov\")\n\tprint(\"albedo=\", albedo, \" metallic=\", metallic, \" roughness=\", roughness, \" viewmodel_fov=\", fov)\n\tassert(albedo.is_equal_approx(Color(0.2, 0.7, 0.9, 1.0)), \"Albedo mismatch\")\n\tassert(is_equal_approx(metallic, 0.2), \"Metallic mismatch\")\n\tassert(is_equal_approx(roughness, 0.8), \"Roughness mismatch\")\n\tassert(is_equal_approx(fov, 54.0), \"viewmodel_fov mismatch\")\n\n\tprint(\"ALL CHECKS PASSED\")\n\tquit(0)\nEOF\ncp /tmp/opencode/gd_verify/verify_main.gd /workspace/verify_main.gd 2>/dev/null || true; ls /workspace"},"output":"output.wav\noutput00000000.png\nproject.godot\nscenes\nscripts\nshaders\ntask_config.json\nverify_main.gd\n","metadata":{"output":"output.wav\noutput00000000.png\nproject.godot\nscenes\nscripts\nshaders\ntask_config.json\nverify_main.gd\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"mkdir -p /tmp/opencode/gd_verify && cat > /tmp/opencode/gd_verify/verify_main.gd <<'EOF'\nextends SceneTree\n\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tcall_deferred(\"_run\")\n\nfunc _run() -> void:\n\tawait process_frame\n\tawait process_frame\n\tvar main_scene := load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\") as PackedScene\n\tvar main := main_scene.instantiate()\n\troot.add_child(main)\n\tawait process_frame\n\tawait process_frame\n\n\tvar wm := main.get_node(\"WeaponManager\")\n\tvar vm := wm.get_node(\"ViewModel\")\n\tvar knife := vm.get_node(\"Knife\") as MeshInstance3D\n\tassert(knife != null, \"Knife MeshInstance3D should exist\")\n\n\tvar override_count := knife.get_surface_override_material_count()\n\tprint(\"Surface override count: \", override_count)\n\tassert(override_count >= 1, \"Expected at least one surface override material\")\n\n\tvar mat := knife.get_surface_override_material(0)\n\tprint(\"Material class: \", mat.get_class())\n\tassert(mat is ShaderMaterial, \"Expected ShaderMaterial override\")\n\tvar sm := mat as ShaderMaterial\n\tassert(sm.shader != null, \"Shader should be set\")\n\tprint(\"Shader path: \", sm.shader.resource_path)\n\tassert(sm.shader.resource_path == \"res://shaders/weapon_clip_and_fov_shader.gdshader\", \"Shader path mismatch\")\n\n\tvar albedo: Color = sm.get_shader_parameter(\"albedo\")\n\tvar metallic: float = sm.get_shader_parameter(\"metallic\")\n\tvar roughness: float = sm.get_shader_parameter(\"roughness\")\n\tvar fov: float = sm.get_shader_parameter(\"viewmodel_fov\")\n\tprint(\"albedo=\", albedo, \" metallic=\", metallic, \" roughness=\", roughness, \" viewmodel_fov=\", fov)\n\tassert(albedo.is_equal_approx(Color(0.2, 0.7, 0.9, 1.0)), \"Albedo mismatch\")\n\tassert(is_equal_approx(metallic, 0.2), \"Metallic mismatch\")\n\tassert(is_equal_approx(roughness, 0.8), \"Roughness mismatch\")\n\tassert(is_equal_approx(fov, 54.0), \"viewmodel_fov mismatch\")\n\n\tprint(\"ALL CHECKS PASSED\")\n\tquit(0)\nEOF\ncp /tmp/opencode/gd_verify/verify_main.gd /workspace/verify_main.gd 2>/dev/null || true; ls /workspace","time":{"start":1790451388666,"end":1790451388694}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_bash_22_04901eef"}},"id":"prt_0df3810f3001191nHaRkBWyLVv","sessionID":"ses_f20cc3857ffezDR2odMktEeN9P","messageID":"msg_0df37a89a001AhCrPidxGwfbu8"}}
