{"type":"text","timestamp":1790451423977,"sessionID":"ses_f20cc3857ffezDR2odMktEeN9P","part":{"id":"prt_0df389ad000112fEe3c07Dr1nk","messageID":"msg_0df386123001ikDk1x13F45HbE","sessionID":"ses_f20cc3857ffezDR2odMktEeN9P","type":"text","text":"The task is complete. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Implementation: View Model Clip Shader Swap\n\n**File modified:** `scripts/weapon_manager.gd`\n\n### What the implementation does\n\n1. **`_ready()`** — Calls `apply_clip_and_fov_shader_to_view_model(view_model_container, 54.0)`, applying the shader swap to the view model subtree with the required 54.0 FOV.\n\n2. **`apply_clip_and_fov_shader_to_view_model(node3d, fov_or_negative_for_unchanged)`** —\n   - Loads the shader `res://shaders/weapon_clip_and_fov_shader.gdshader`\n   - Recursively collects all `MeshInstance3D` nodes under the given node\n   - For each mesh surface, resolves the base material (preferring surface override materials, falling back to mesh surface materials)\n   - Creates a new `ShaderMaterial` using the clip/FOV shader\n   - Copies the base material parameters into the shader (see below)\n   - Sets `viewmodel_fov` to the provided FOV (54.0 when applied from `_ready`)\n   - Assigns it via `set_surface_override_material`\n\n3. **Parameter copying** (`_copy_material_parameters`) — From `StandardMaterial3D` it copies `albedo` (albedo color), `metallic`, `roughness`, `specular`, plus optional albedo/metallic/roughness/normal textures and UV transforms. From an existing `ShaderMaterial` it copies the same parameter names (and preserves `viewmodel_fov` when shaders match).\n\n### Verification\n\nA runtime verification script instantiated the scene in headless Godot 4.4.1 and confirmed:\n\n- Knife's surface override material is a `ShaderMaterial` with `res://shaders/weapon_clip_and_fov_shader.gdshader`\n- `albedo = (0.2, 0.7, 0.9, 1.0)`, `metallic = 0.2`, `roughness = 0.8` — all copied from the base material\n- `viewmodel_fov = 54.0`\n- Full project runs cleanly with no script errors (exit code 0)","time":{"start":1790451423952,"end":1790451423956},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_98193f2da65440f48ce6ed6babd7683d_msg"}}}}
